{筹码集中度副图（对齐 MOCKUP：白=C90 / 紫=C70 / 虚线=阈值 / 青柱=吸筹 / 箭头=买卖）}
C90:(COST(95)-COST(5))/(COST(95)+COST(5))*100,COLORWHITE,LINETHICK2;
C70:(COST(85)-COST(15))/(COST(85)+COST(15))*100,COLORMAGENTA,LINETHICK1;
极品线:12,DOTLINE,COLORBLUE;
风险线:20,DOTLINE,COLORGREEN;
零轴:0,COLORGRAY,LINETHICK1;
顶轴:40,COLORGRAY,LINETHICK1;
低位:=CLOSE<HHV(H,250)*0.72;
高位:=CLOSE>HHV(H,120)*0.85;
上移:=COST(50)>REF(COST(50),20)*1.05;
吸筹区:=低位 AND C90<=25;
STICKLINE(吸筹区,0,8,2,0),COLORCYAN;
吸筹起:=吸筹区 AND REF(吸筹区,1)=0;
吸筹续标:=吸筹区 AND MOD(BARSLAST(吸筹起),15)=0 AND BARSLAST(吸筹起)>0;
DRAWTEXT(吸筹起 OR 吸筹续标,11,'吸筹'),COLORCYAN;
买:=CROSS(CLOSE,COST(95)) AND VOL>MA(VOL,5)*1.2;
买首触:=买 AND REF(买,1)=0;
卖:=CROSS(REF(COST(5),1),CLOSE) AND VOL>MA(VOL,5)*1.2;
卖首触:=卖 AND REF(卖,1)=0;
DRAWICON(买首触,C90,1);
DRAWTEXT(买首触,C90*1.15,'买'),COLORRED;
DRAWICON(卖首触,C90,2);
DRAWTEXT(卖首触,C90*0.85,'卖'),COLORGREEN;
状态:=IF(低位 AND C90<=15,'状态:低位吸筹',IF(高位 AND WINNER(CLOSE)>0.9 AND 上移,'状态:高位派筹',IF(高位 AND C90>20,'状态:高位风险','状态:观望蓄势')));
DRAWTEXT(CURRBARSCOUNT=1,38,状态),COLORWHITE;
